-- Own product taxonomy seed (authored for Svita; schema v1).
-- Unlabeled statements execute when the database is first created.
--
-- Subtype keys and thermal classes mirror the outfit engine's functional
-- subtype->class mapping (the engine falls back to class N for unknown keys);
-- en/uk display names are authored for this product.
-- Seed ids start at 1000 so user rows and test fixtures stay in the low range.

